{"id":"1a9ee90cf68134db","group":"56","path":"56/56-prop-trace-ancestry.md","title":"动态祖先存在与静态顶点来源唯一","display":"prop-trace-ancestry — 动态祖先存在与静态顶点来源唯一","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-prop-trace-ancestry","aliases":["56-prop-trace-ancestry"],"display":"prop-trace-ancestry — 动态祖先存在与静态顶点来源唯一","depends_on":["[[56-df-proofterm-traces]]","[[56-df-left-linear]]"],"source_section":"§8.6.1 Proposition 8.6.11; Exercise 8.6.12","source_printed_pages":"391–392","source_statement_status":"dynamic-clause-compared; static-clause-restricted-to-vertices-after-collapse-counterexample","source_proof_status":"local-structural-induction; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-prop-trace-ancestry"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-prop-trace-ancestry</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-trace-ancestry — 动态祖先存在与静态顶点来源唯一"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"613e5d5bb6ec9bee\" href=\"?note=613e5d5bb6ec9bee\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-traces\">56-df-proofterm-traces</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7fe49a97f5aa4b2b\" href=\"?note=7fe49a97f5aa4b2b\" title=\"56-df-left-linear\">56-df-left-linear</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.6.1 Proposition 8.6.11; Exercise 8.6.12"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"391–392"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"dynamic-clause-compared; static-clause-restricted-to-vertices-after-collapse-counterexample"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-structural-induction; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"613e5d5bb6ec9bee\" href=\"?note=613e5d5bb6ec9bee\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-traces\">56-df-proofterm-traces</a>，变量集记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>；假设 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7fe49a97f5aa4b2b\" href=\"?note=7fe49a97f5aa4b2b\" title=\"56-df-left-linear\">56-df-left-linear</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftLinear}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftLinear}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 实例化该上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R\">\\(\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=S_R(\\phi)\">\\(s=S_R(\\phi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=T_R(\\phi)\">\\(t=T_R(\\phi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)\">\\(q\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z,z&#39;\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\">\\(z,z&#39;\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(t)\\;\\exists z\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\;(z,w)\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(t)\\;\\exists z\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\;(z,w)\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl((z,V(q))\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\land(z&#39;,V(q))\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\bigr)\\Rightarrow z=z&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl((z,V(q))\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\land(z&#39;,V(q))\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\bigr)\\Rightarrow z=z&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(z,V(q))\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\Rightarrow z\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\times\\{1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(z,V(q))\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\Rightarrow z\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\times\\{1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{w\\mid(E(\\epsilon),w)\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\phi)\\}=\\{E(\\epsilon)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{w\\mid(E(\\epsilon),w)\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\phi)\\}=\\{E(\\epsilon)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对证明项归纳。包含关系在每个构造器下保持。动态祖先存在的规则case中，目标模式位置由非空左模式供给；右变量的每个实例位置由某个左变量出现供给，因规则不得引入新右变量；目标根边由源根边供给。函数、变量、组合case直接继承覆盖性。</p>\n<p>静态追踪始终保持类型；到目标顶点的静态来源只可能在同一个变量实例或未收缩上文中。左线性使左变量出现位置唯一，子归纳使实例内部来源唯一，组合时两层唯一性相乘。根入边只有自身作为其正向动态目标，由每个构造器公式直接检查。目标边的静态来源可在collapsing时合并，故本原子没有全边逆函数断言。</p>\n<p>原书8.6.11的第一句适用于所有位置，第二句按字面在collapsing边上失败；本轮明确记录并使用其正确的顶点限制版。有限例子见本轮collapsing trace原子及报告，不能用未发现其它反例替代上述结构归纳。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-proofterm-traces","status":"resolved","id":"613e5d5bb6ec9bee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-proofterm-traces]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-left-linear","status":"resolved","id":"7fe49a97f5aa4b2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-left-linear]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm-traces","status":"resolved","id":"613e5d5bb6ec9bee","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-proofterm-traces]]，变量集记为 $\\mathcal V$；假设 [[56-df-left-linear]] 的 $\\mathrm{LeftLinear}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)$，其中 $\\mathcal V$ 实例化该上游的 $V$。$\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$，$s=S_R(\\phi)$，$t=T_R(\\phi)$，$q\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)$；$z,z'\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(s)$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-left-linear","status":"resolved","id":"7fe49a97f5aa4b2b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-proofterm-traces]]，变量集记为 $\\mathcal V$；假设 [[56-df-left-linear]] 的 $\\mathrm{LeftLinear}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)$，其中 $\\mathcal V$ 实例化该上游的 $V$。$\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$，$s=S_R(\\phi)$，$t=T_R(\\phi)$，$q\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)$；$z,z'\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(s)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftLinear}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R","display":false},{"tex":"s=S_R(\\phi)","display":false},{"tex":"t=T_R(\\phi)","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"z,z'\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\phi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(t)\\;\\exists z\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(s)\\;(z,w)\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\phi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigl((z,V(q))\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\land(z',V(q))\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\bigr)\\Rightarrow z=z'.","display":true},{"tex":"(z,V(q))\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\Rightarrow z\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\times\\{1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\{w\\mid(E(\\epsilon),w)\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\phi)\\}=\\{E(\\epsilon)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2597,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-prop-trace-ancestry.md]]"}],"outgoing":["613e5d5bb6ec9bee","7fe49a97f5aa4b2b"]}